===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|pénkʷe}}
From {{inh|en|enm|fynger}}, {{m|enm|finger}}, from {{der|en|ang|finger||finger}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*fingr}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*fingraz||finger}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*penkʷrós}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*pénkʷe||five}}. Compare {{cog|fy|finger}}, [[w:Low German|Low German]]/{{cog|de|Finger}}, {{cog|nl|vinger}}, {{cog|da,no,sv|finger}}; also {{cog|xcl|հինգերորդ|հինգեր-որդ|fifth}}. More at {{m|en|five}}.

